    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I don't have a clear answer today: anaphylaxis is possible, and so is a severe allergic reaction.",
