      "evidence_id": "EV_025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I want monitoring done, that's for anaphylaxis. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. The treatment will be adrenaline, 0.5 milligrams, once now, single dose. It's for anaphylaxis. Lie flat with your legs raised, I am giving the injection now.",
